# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data artifacts — IRB-PROTECTED. Do not commit.
#
# The DAACS corpus contains student essay text joined to demographic
# covariates. Nothing derived from it belongs in this repository, including
# "processed" or "cleaned" intermediates: the STM `meta` object carries the
# essay text and the demographics through every downstream stage.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore only affects UNTRACKED files. `processed_corpus_final.Rdata`
# is currently tracked and is NOT excluded by these rules — removing it from
# the index and from history is a separate, deliberate step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# R data / model serialization
*.Rdata
*.RData
*.rdata
*.Rda
*.rda
*.rds
*.RDS

# Pipeline intermediates (preclean_text.csv, stm_data_final.csv, remove.csv, ...)
*.csv

# Generated essay/passage output trees
Essay_Passages/
Top Essays/
Passages-*/

# Project-internal working documents — kept locally, not published here.
# CODE_REVIEW.md is the defect log; results/RESULTS.md is the preliminary
# results document, regenerated by scripts/build_results.R. Both are still
# referenced from the notebooks and README, and both still exist in this
# repository's history — untracking a file does not remove earlier commits.
CODE_REVIEW.md
results/RESULTS.md
Outstanding_items_*.md

# Knitted reports — regenerate rather than commit; HTML output embeds
# data frames printed by `df_print: paged` chunks.
*.html
*_files/
*_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R session and tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.Rproj.user/
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
*.Rcheck/

# renv manages its own exclusions in renv/.gitignore (library/, staging/, etc.).
# renv.lock, .Rprofile, renv/activate.R and renv/settings.json ARE committed --
# they are what makes the environment reproducible.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# In-project scratch (lint baselines, diffs) - never committed
.scratch/
